// Naive blocklist that only strips <script> — trivially bypassed
String clean = input.replace("<script>", "");
// Bypass:  <img src=x onerror=alert(1)>   or   <SCRIPT>  or  <scr<script>ipt>
```
*Blocklists miss event handlers, mixed case, and nesting tricks — they don't work.*

