// For the ONE field that must store HTML, sanitize with an allowlist...
PolicyFactory policy = Sanitizers.FORMATTING.and(Sanitizers.LINKS);
user.setBio(policy.sanitize(rawBio));
// ...and still treat it carefully on output. Encoding remains the baseline.
```
*Output encoding is the constant baseline; sanitization is the targeted extra for HTML-bearing fields.*

